Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(app): the span-sized lattice is only for the empty
 plan; pin the no-stock refusal

Review of #599: the guard now falls back only on exactly +inf (no tool
cut); a NaN or negative radius still reaches auto_cell and is refused
by name. The no-stock test requires the by-name 'no stock' refusal
instead of passing on an empty note.

Refs #592

